01:01:19.430 --> 01:01:32.960
<v Ira Glass>Sean Cole, Mike Comite, Sarah Koenig, Safiyah Riddle, Matt Tierney, and Jessica Weisberg did the work to put this Serial episode onto our program. Special thanks today to Talia Baiocchi, Alison Beckman at the Center for the Victims of Torture, Nina Lassam, Alvin Melathe, and Tug Wilson.
<v Ira Glass>肖恩·科尔、迈克·科米特、萨拉·凯尼格、萨菲亚·里德尔、马特·蒂尔尼和杰西卡·魏斯伯格完成了将这一集《Serial》放入我们节目的工作。今天特别感谢Talia Baiocchi、酷刑受害者中心的Alison Beckman、Nina Lassam、Alvin Melathe和Tug Wilson。

01:01:32.960 --> 01:01:44.510
